{
  "schema": "world-front-policy",
  "version": 1,
  "principle": "future canon is conditional pressure; only committed ordinary-domain events may advance a front",
  "bootstrap_principle": "A latent front may be seeded only by a material action that the saved source faction was already lawfully allowed to take under its normal autonomy profile. Bootstrap routing never invents a future-canon outcome, hidden fact, resource, participant, or success.",
